WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.400
-The Justice Department

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.501
searched President Biden's home
over the weekend

00:00:04.501 --> 00:00:06.300
and discovered a few more
classified items.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.868
The news has
prompted Republicans,

00:00:07.868 --> 00:00:10.901
who dismissed the much larger
cache of stolen documents

00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:13.567
that Donald Trump refused
to return to criticize Biden.

00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:15.067
And, on top of that,
Republican leaders,

00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:17.667
like Kevin McCarthy,
are also refusing to take action

00:00:17.667 --> 00:00:19.801
against serial liar
George Santos,

00:00:19.801 --> 00:00:21.367
or, you know,
whatever his real name is.

00:00:21.367 --> 00:00:24.033
[ Laughter ]
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:28.167
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:30.167
You know, guys,
after the November midterms,

00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:32.467
things were looking pretty good
for old Joe Biden.

00:00:32.467 --> 00:00:33.901
He had the best
midterm performance

00:00:33.901 --> 00:00:35.467
of a sitting president
in decades,

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:37.868
he'd scored a string
of major legislative victories,

00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:40.133
gas prices were down,
inflation was slowing,

00:00:40.133 --> 00:00:42.200
unemployment was low,
and he was hitting

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.400
his highest approval ratings
in at least a year.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.901
In fact, one recent poll found

00:00:45.901 --> 00:00:49.200
that Biden's net job approval
rating was now positive,

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.901
with 47% approval,
the 45% disapproval.

00:00:51.901 --> 00:00:53.400
So, it was positive,
but like barely.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.834
[ Laughter ]
That's the divided America
we live in now.

00:00:55.834 --> 00:01:00.200
[ As Biden ]
I'm not saying I'm popular,
but 50% of Americans agree.

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:02.000
If you round up!

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.133
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:06.334
Anyway, the point is,
Joe Biden was flying high,

00:01:06.334 --> 00:01:07.934
although, I hesitate to say
he was flying,

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:09.734
given that we all know
how that goes.

00:01:09.734 --> 00:01:11.934
[ Laughter and awws ]

00:01:11.934 --> 00:01:15.601
I'm sorry, but we will never
stop using that clip!

00:01:15.601 --> 00:01:16.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.868 --> 00:01:18.200
I thought it was
physically impossible

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:21.167
to trip up the stairs
that many times.

00:01:21.167 --> 00:01:22.367
Did Kevin McCallister

00:01:22.367 --> 00:01:24.234
"Home Alone" those stairs
in olive oil?

00:01:24.234 --> 00:01:26.567
[ Laughter ]
Although, that shouldn't be
an excuse.

00:01:26.567 --> 00:01:28.834
After the second fall,
even Marv would stop

00:01:28.834 --> 00:01:31.734
[ Laughter ]
and reassess the situation.

00:01:31.734 --> 00:01:33.400
So, Biden was riding high
and then, of course,

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:34.834
the classified documents
story happened,

00:01:34.834 --> 00:01:37.000
and, now, his home
has been searched

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.367
by the Justice Department,
which turned up

00:01:38.367 --> 00:01:40.067
even more classified items.

00:01:40.067 --> 00:01:41.767
-ABC News has learned
authorities spent

00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:43.901
nearly 13 hours on Friday
combing

00:01:43.901 --> 00:01:46.067
through the president's
Wilmington, Delaware, home.

00:01:46.067 --> 00:01:51.868
-The FBI discovered six
additional classified documents.

00:02:18.567 --> 00:02:20.133
-He still had
classified documents

00:02:20.133 --> 00:02:22.434
from his time in the Senate?!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.434 --> 00:02:25.033
Biden's first year
in the Senate was 1973.

00:02:25.033 --> 00:02:27.400
What were these classified
documents all about,

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:29.767
the government's top secret
eight-track technology?

00:02:29.767 --> 00:02:31.367
[ Laughter ]
[ As Biden ] Check this out.

00:02:31.367 --> 00:02:34.634
I swiped these coded messages
from the Pentagon.

00:02:34.634 --> 00:02:35.834
"Don't fear the Reaper."

00:02:35.834 --> 00:02:37.968
[ Laughter ]
What in --

00:02:37.968 --> 00:02:40.400
What in God's name
could that mean?

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:41.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.334 --> 00:02:42.634
I have less trouble believing

00:02:42.634 --> 00:02:44.033
that Biden had
classified documents

00:02:44.033 --> 00:02:45.334
from his time as vice president.

00:02:45.334 --> 00:02:48.734
He didn't exactly give off
the elder statesman vibe

00:02:48.734 --> 00:02:50.200
during his eight years
with Obama.

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:51.801
I mean, does this look like

00:02:51.801 --> 00:02:53.734
[ Laughter ]
the face of a guy

00:02:53.734 --> 00:02:55.701
who is serious
about document security?

00:02:55.701 --> 00:02:57.267
He looks like he's
about to roll a joint

00:02:57.267 --> 00:02:59.067
with a piece of paper
marked top secret.

00:02:59.067 --> 00:03:02.200
[ Laughter ]
You guys, it is so funny
to look back at that.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:05.367
I definitely thought
that was the vibe of a dude

00:03:05.367 --> 00:03:07.267
in his last job ever.

00:03:07.267 --> 00:03:08.901
[ Laughter ]
Turns out --

00:03:08.901 --> 00:03:11.000
Turns out he was interning.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.834
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.834 --> 00:03:15.767
Also, investigators were
at Biden's home for 13 hours.

00:03:15.767 --> 00:03:18.200
I have nothing to hide
in my apartment,

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:20.534
but if you told me someone
looked for 13 hours,

00:03:20.534 --> 00:03:22.267
I would definitely think,
"Oh, [bleep]."

00:03:22.267 --> 00:03:25.334
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.334 --> 00:03:27.033
So, again, this isn't great
for Biden.

00:03:27.033 --> 00:03:28.434
He shouldn't have had
those documents.

00:03:28.434 --> 00:03:31.167
But the revelations have led
to some very silly punditry,

00:03:31.167 --> 00:03:32.200
claiming Biden is, somehow,

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:33.634
in the same position
as Donald Trump.

00:03:33.634 --> 00:03:35.033
-You heard from the Republicans.

00:03:35.033 --> 00:03:37.234
They see a moment, Erica,

00:03:37.234 --> 00:03:38.868
that, you know, certainly,

00:03:38.868 --> 00:03:41.234
for the White House
and for President Biden,

00:03:41.234 --> 00:03:43.200
who are claiming to have
the moral high ground,

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:46.000
they see that
that is not so anymore.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.734
-Do you fear that,
because of that,

00:03:48.734 --> 00:03:51.234
the current president
has kind of lost

00:03:51.234 --> 00:03:52.968
the high ground on this notion

00:03:52.968 --> 00:03:56.033
of classified information
being where it shouldn't be?

00:03:56.033 --> 00:03:58.634
-It simply has taken away

00:03:58.634 --> 00:04:01.367
the moral high ground
of this presidency.

00:04:01.367 --> 00:04:03.567
-Okay, first of all, Biden can
still reach the high ground.

00:04:03.567 --> 00:04:05.501
He just stumbles a bit
on the way there.

00:04:05.501 --> 00:04:08.133
[ Laughter ]
Guys, again,

00:04:08.133 --> 00:04:09.901
you need to be ready,
at any moment,

00:04:09.901 --> 00:04:12.167
[ Laughter ]
for the stairs video.

00:04:12.167 --> 00:04:13.434
I cannot stress this enough.

00:04:13.434 --> 00:04:15.334
We're not going to stop.
Not just because it's funny

00:04:15.334 --> 00:04:17.267
or because Biden is the most
powerful person in the world,

00:04:17.267 --> 00:04:19.200
but because it is
scientifically fascinating.

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.601
[ Laughter ]

00:04:20.601 --> 00:04:23.000
How do you keep tripping
while also moving upward?

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:24.634
[ Laughter ]

00:04:24.634 --> 00:04:26.367
If you showed this video
to Isaac Newton,

00:04:26.367 --> 00:04:28.467
he'd burn all his notebooks
and start over.

00:04:28.467 --> 00:04:30.100
[ Laughter ]

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:32.868
But that was almost certainly
the last time

00:04:32.868 --> 00:04:34.767
we will play that clip today.

00:04:34.767 --> 00:04:36.100
[ Laughter ]

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:37.701
We've shown it twice.

00:04:37.701 --> 00:04:38.868
[ Laughter ]

00:04:38.868 --> 00:04:40.901
If I know anything
about comedy...

00:04:40.901 --> 00:04:42.100
[ Laughter ]

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:44.834
...it's the rule that twice is
more than enough!

00:04:44.834 --> 00:04:46.801
[ Laughter ]

00:04:46.801 --> 00:04:49.334
Now, as we've said before,
and we'll say again,

00:04:49.334 --> 00:04:51.067
there's no equivalence
between Biden and Trump.

00:04:51.067 --> 00:04:54.067
Yes, it's bad that they both
had classified documents,

00:04:54.067 --> 00:04:56.334
but Trump consistently lied
about the documents he had;

00:04:56.334 --> 00:04:58.801
told his staff to lie;
defied multiple requests

00:04:58.801 --> 00:05:00.267
and a subpoena
for the documents;

00:05:00.267 --> 00:05:02.334
moved the documents around;
and repeatedly changed the story

00:05:02.334 --> 00:05:04.634
about why he had the documents,
in the first place.

00:05:04.634 --> 00:05:06.400
Biden shouldn't have
had the documents,

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:07.534
but he never claimed
they were his

00:05:07.534 --> 00:05:08.901
and he definitely never claimed

00:05:08.901 --> 00:05:12.901
he had secretly declassified
them using his mind.

00:05:12.901 --> 00:05:15.267
-You had said, on Truth Social,
a number of times,

00:05:15.267 --> 00:05:17.334
you did declassify.
-I did declassify, yes.

00:05:17.334 --> 00:05:20.634
-Okay. Is there a process?
What was your process

00:05:20.634 --> 00:05:21.968
to declassify?
-It doesn't have to be

00:05:21.968 --> 00:05:23.801
a process, as I understand it.

00:05:23.801 --> 00:05:25.601
You know, there's different
people say different things,

00:05:25.601 --> 00:05:27.234
but as I understand,
there doesn't have to be.

00:05:27.234 --> 00:05:28.934
If you're the president
of the United States,

00:05:28.934 --> 00:05:31.968
you can declassify just
by saying it's declassified,

00:05:31.968 --> 00:05:33.467
even by thinking about it.

00:05:33.467 --> 00:05:35.467
[ Laughter ]
-That is for sure

00:05:35.467 --> 00:05:36.868
Donald Trump's dream,

00:05:36.868 --> 00:05:38.767
[ Laughter ]
that thinking
about doing something

00:05:38.767 --> 00:05:40.467
is the same
as actually doing it.

00:05:40.467 --> 00:05:43.234
Donald, did you get Eric
a birthday present?

00:05:43.234 --> 00:05:44.667
[ As Trump ]
I did something as good,

00:05:44.667 --> 00:05:46.467
some might even say
even better --

00:05:46.467 --> 00:05:47.334
I thought about it.

00:05:47.334 --> 00:05:48.734
[ Laughter ]
I thought --

00:05:48.734 --> 00:05:50.567
I thought
about a big motorcycle,

00:05:50.567 --> 00:05:51.834
which I think Eric would love,

00:05:51.834 --> 00:05:53.200
if that's the sort
of thing he's into.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:54.968
I'll admit,
I do not talk to him much.

00:05:54.968 --> 00:05:58.701
[ Laughter ]
A great big, loud motorcycle
with a bow on the handlebars.

00:05:58.701 --> 00:05:59.968
So, I think
we can all agree that,

00:05:59.968 --> 00:06:01.968
if I'm not Dad of the year,
I'm at least Top 5.

00:06:01.968 --> 00:06:03.634
[ Laughter ]

00:06:03.634 --> 00:06:05.901
Then last week, Trump changed
his tune, yet again,

00:06:05.901 --> 00:06:06.901
and claimed he had taken

00:06:06.901 --> 00:06:10.133
empty classified folders
as a memento

00:06:10.133 --> 00:06:12.434
and that the feds,
who he called Gestapo

00:06:12.434 --> 00:06:14.234
and "Trump Hating
Marxist Thugs" --

00:06:14.234 --> 00:06:16.000
you know, like you do
when you're innocent --

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:18.868
[ Laughter ]
had possibly planted
classified documents

00:06:18.868 --> 00:06:20.133
inside those empty folders.

00:06:20.133 --> 00:06:21.200
-Quoting, now..

00:06:42.501 --> 00:06:45.868
-Who takes home empty folders
as a cool keepsake?

00:06:45.868 --> 00:06:47.200
[ Laughter ]

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:49.267
Also, what 76-year-old says

00:06:49.267 --> 00:06:51.100
"'cool' keepsake"?
[ Laughter ]

00:06:51.100 --> 00:06:52.601
[ As Trump ]
You guys should come over later

00:06:52.601 --> 00:06:54.767
and check out
my cool keepsakes, yeah.

00:06:54.767 --> 00:06:56.434
[ Laughter ]

00:06:56.434 --> 00:07:00.234
I don't want to give anything
away, but here's a hint --

00:07:00.234 --> 00:07:01.767
folders!

00:07:01.767 --> 00:07:05.133
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:05.133 --> 00:07:08.000
[ Cheering ]

00:07:09.901 --> 00:07:13.267
Yeah, no, I took -- I took all
the good stuff out.

00:07:13.267 --> 00:07:14.968
[ Laughter ]

00:07:14.968 --> 00:07:17.467
Just an empty folder.

00:07:17.467 --> 00:07:18.534
You guys want pizza?

00:07:18.534 --> 00:07:19.601
I got empty boxes.

00:07:19.601 --> 00:07:23.801
[ Laughter ]

00:07:23.801 --> 00:07:25.300
Here's the difference
between Biden and Trump --

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:27.567
they're like two guys who got
pulled over for erratic driving.

00:07:27.567 --> 00:07:29.033
Biden immediately rolls
down the window,

00:07:29.033 --> 00:07:30.601
hands over his license
and registration,

00:07:30.601 --> 00:07:31.968
passes the breathalyzer,
and says,

00:07:31.968 --> 00:07:33.133
"Sorry, officer,
but in my defense,

00:07:33.133 --> 00:07:34.868
even stone cold sober,
I do this --"

00:07:34.868 --> 00:07:38.300
[ Laughter and applause ]
And that's

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:40.167
what we call the rule of threes!

00:07:40.167 --> 00:07:42.901
[ Electronic voice ]

00:07:42.901 --> 00:07:44.367
[ Vuvuzela blasts ]

00:07:44.367 --> 00:07:47.334
[ Heavy metal
guitar sting plays ]

00:07:47.334 --> 00:07:48.934
-♪ Oh, yeah ♪

00:07:48.934 --> 00:07:51.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:52.767 --> 00:07:54.033
-Trump, on the other hand,
is the guy

00:07:54.033 --> 00:07:56.000
who refuses to pull over,
gets chased down,

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:58.000
goes over those one-way spikes
in a parking lot,

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:59.767
blows out his tire,
drives for another mile

00:07:59.767 --> 00:08:02.200
[ Laughter ]
on sparking rims,
crashes into a duck pond,

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:03.734
gives cocaine and a gun
to a duck,

00:08:03.734 --> 00:08:05.400
[ Laughter ]
and says if anyone asks,
"This is yours!"

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:07.033
Tries to swim away,
even though the pond

00:08:07.033 --> 00:08:08.734
is shallow enough to stand;
gets to the other side,

00:08:08.734 --> 00:08:10.300
[ Laughter ]
where the police are waiting
for him, and says,

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:13.868
"Oh, I didn't realize
I was living in Soviet Russia."

00:08:13.868 --> 00:08:15.601
[ Laughter ]

00:08:15.601 --> 00:08:17.834
Again, it's possible to hold

00:08:17.834 --> 00:08:19.467
two thoughts in our heads
at once.

00:08:19.467 --> 00:08:21.367
Biden shouldn't have had
those documents,

00:08:21.367 --> 00:08:23.667
but also, comparing these
two situations is ludicrous,

00:08:23.667 --> 00:08:25.934
which is why Republicans
suddenly find themselves

00:08:25.934 --> 00:08:27.334
in the awkward position
of trying

00:08:27.334 --> 00:08:28.601
to defend
their prior statements,

00:08:28.601 --> 00:08:30.400
dismissing the Trump scandal,

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:33.067
while also hyperventilating
about the Biden documents.

00:08:33.067 --> 00:08:34.934
And, in particular,
they seem to be focused

00:08:34.934 --> 00:08:37.100
on one very specific aspect
of the Trump search.

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:40.701
-My concern is how there's
such a discrepancy

00:08:40.701 --> 00:08:42.634
in how former President Trump
was treated --

00:08:42.634 --> 00:08:45.534
by raiding Mar-A-Lago,
by getting the security cameras,

00:08:45.534 --> 00:08:48.434
by taking pictures of documents
on the floor,

00:08:48.434 --> 00:08:50.300
by going
through Melania's closet.

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:54.267
-There's no armed FBI raid
of Jill's closet,

00:08:54.267 --> 00:08:55.667
the first lady's first closet,

00:08:55.667 --> 00:08:57.601
as they did
with Melania Trump's closet.

00:08:57.601 --> 00:09:00.367
-My point had been --
and remains --

00:09:00.367 --> 00:09:01.934
the attorney general

00:09:01.934 --> 00:09:04.033
had several steps
he could go through

00:09:04.033 --> 00:09:06.133
before he's playing around

00:09:06.133 --> 00:09:08.267
in Melania's closet.
-But it went --

00:09:08.267 --> 00:09:11.367
-Are they going to rifle
through Jill Biden's closet,

00:09:11.367 --> 00:09:12.767
like they did to Melania?

00:09:12.767 --> 00:09:15.400
-They raided President Trump's
Mar-A-Lago home,

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:17.767
going through Melania's closet
and drawers

00:09:17.767 --> 00:09:19.534
in a despicable manner.

00:09:19.534 --> 00:09:21.467
-It's like they realize they
can't defend Trump anymore,

00:09:21.467 --> 00:09:23.167
so they pivoted
to defending Melania.

00:09:23.167 --> 00:09:24.968
"How can they do that
to this poor woman?

00:09:24.968 --> 00:09:27.200
Isn't it bad enough
she's married to Donald Trump?"

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:29.434
[ Laughter ]
Now let's compare
the GOP's fevered reaction

00:09:29.434 --> 00:09:32.467
over Biden's documents to their
much more cautious approach

00:09:32.467 --> 00:09:34.367
to the many scandals
of a congressman

00:09:34.367 --> 00:09:36.400
[ Laughing ]
supposedly name George Santos.

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:38.501
[ Laughter ]
As a reminder, Santos has lied

00:09:38.501 --> 00:09:41.834
about virtually every aspect
of his life and résumé,

00:09:41.834 --> 00:09:44.000
even down to his name
and his clothes.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:46.701
-It seems like every day
we're learning something else

00:09:46.701 --> 00:09:49.767
about George Santos' life
that simply isn't true.

00:09:49.767 --> 00:09:51.767
Now, he's being accused
of stealing funds

00:09:51.767 --> 00:09:54.000
from a homeless veteran's
dying dog

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:56.767
and lying about his mother
being a 9/11 survivor.

00:09:56.767 --> 00:09:59.400
-There's a staggering amount
of fantastical tales

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:01.467
George Santos has told
through the years.

00:10:01.467 --> 00:10:03.834
Saying he caught a severe
early case of COVID,

00:10:03.834 --> 00:10:05.534
even though he was on TV
four days later,

00:10:05.534 --> 00:10:08.868
or claiming to be
a "proud American Jew"

00:10:08.868 --> 00:10:10.834
whose parents fled Hitler,

00:10:10.834 --> 00:10:12.367
even though
he's actually Catholic

00:10:12.367 --> 00:10:14.501
and has no Jewish ancestors,

00:10:14.501 --> 00:10:16.234
as far as we can tell
from the records.

00:10:16.234 --> 00:10:18.667
Said he owned
13 different properties,

00:10:18.667 --> 00:10:20.234
when he's never been a landlord.

00:10:20.234 --> 00:10:22.200
-This is the same George Santos
who said he worked

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:23.868
at Goldman Sachs,
which was a lie;

00:10:23.868 --> 00:10:25.701
who said he worked at Citigroup,
which he didn't,

00:10:25.701 --> 00:10:27.434
meaning that, too, was a lie.

00:10:27.434 --> 00:10:28.801
It's the same George Santos
who lied

00:10:28.801 --> 00:10:30.567
about the high school
he went to in New York

00:10:30.567 --> 00:10:32.434
and the college he said
he graduated from.

00:10:32.434 --> 00:10:34.534
He said it was Baruch College
and he got a degree

00:10:34.534 --> 00:10:36.367
in economics and finance.
He didn't.

00:10:36.367 --> 00:10:37.868
-More questions are being raised

00:10:37.868 --> 00:10:40.601
about New York
Congressman George Santos,

00:10:40.601 --> 00:10:43.167
including if that's even
his real name.

00:10:43.167 --> 00:10:44.467
An ex-roommate

00:10:44.467 --> 00:10:47.701
of the freshman congressman
had this to say --

00:10:47.701 --> 00:10:49.901
-I've always known him
as Anthony Devolder.

00:10:49.901 --> 00:10:52.634
[ Laughter and applause ]
I've never known him
as George Santos.

00:11:02.434 --> 00:11:04.067
-Also allegedly stolen
by George,

00:11:04.067 --> 00:11:05.868
according to these two men,

00:11:05.868 --> 00:11:07.367
this Burberry scarf

00:11:07.367 --> 00:11:08.501
[ Laughter and applause ]
that George wore

00:11:08.501 --> 00:11:11.167
to a pro-Trump rally
in Washington, D.C.

00:11:11.167 --> 00:11:13.200
-That's right,
he stole a Burberry scarf.

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:14.734
Even worse, he stole it from...

00:11:14.734 --> 00:11:16.067
-Melania's closet.

00:11:16.067 --> 00:11:17.901
[ Laughter and applause ]
In fact,

00:11:17.901 --> 00:11:20.334
not only did he wear
a stolen scarf,

00:11:20.334 --> 00:11:22.901
he wore it
at a Stop the Steal rally

00:11:22.901 --> 00:11:24.234
[ Laughter ]
on January 5th.

00:11:24.234 --> 00:11:26.868
This guy's lies range
from his job to his education,

00:11:26.868 --> 00:11:28.567
to his name,
to the clothes he wore.

00:11:28.567 --> 00:11:30.434
We have no idea
who he really is.

00:11:30.434 --> 00:11:31.534
He could be anyone.

00:11:31.534 --> 00:11:33.234
-Yeah, Seth, he could be anyone.

00:11:33.234 --> 00:11:36.000
-Wally, is that your real hair?

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:37.400
-Oh, what,
does it look different?

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:39.367
Sorry, I can't see anything
without my glasses.

00:11:39.367 --> 00:11:41.667
[ Laughter ]

00:11:41.667 --> 00:11:43.567
[ Applause ]

00:11:43.567 --> 00:11:47.434
[ Cheering ]

00:11:47.434 --> 00:11:48.834
Uh --

00:11:48.834 --> 00:11:50.968
By the way, Seth, remind me
to give you back your scarf.

00:11:50.968 --> 00:11:52.000
-Wally!

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:54.701
[ Laughter ]
Or should I say, George!

00:11:54.701 --> 00:11:57.367
Or should I say, Anthony!
[ Laughter ]

00:11:57.367 --> 00:11:59.133
Anyway, Santos returned
to New York this weekend,

00:11:59.133 --> 00:12:00.601
where he was greeted
by reporters,

00:12:00.601 --> 00:12:02.534
and he told them he couldn't
answer their questions

00:12:02.534 --> 00:12:04.234
because the information
was classified.

00:12:04.234 --> 00:12:05.934
-I'm focused on serving
the American people

00:12:05.934 --> 00:12:07.601
and I'm super excited of it.

00:12:08.334 --> 00:12:09.501
Yes, I have, plenty!

00:12:09.501 --> 00:12:11.501
I just -- I went --

00:12:11.501 --> 00:12:14.200
I went to D.C. last night
for a meeting

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:15.934
and I'm back here today.
I was here all week

00:12:15.934 --> 00:12:17.701
and it's been fabulous
serving the people.

00:12:19.167 --> 00:12:20.834
That's classified.

00:12:20.834 --> 00:12:22.501
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, it's classified?

00:12:22.501 --> 00:12:24.300
Well, good news --
classified now means

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:26.400
you can take it home and just
show it to whoever you want.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:27.567
[ Laughter ]

00:12:27.567 --> 00:12:29.501
So, Santos is refusing
to answer questions

00:12:29.501 --> 00:12:31.467
about as many scandals
and, yet, the House speaker,

00:12:31.467 --> 00:12:33.133
Kevin McCarthy,
is standing by him.

00:12:33.133 --> 00:12:34.801
-Kevin McCarthy,
the House speaker,

00:12:34.801 --> 00:12:37.167
indicated that he was not going
to take any action

00:12:37.167 --> 00:12:39.267
on George Santos,
indicating, instead,

00:12:39.267 --> 00:12:41.000
this would go through the
House ethics process

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:43.367
and then they will decide what
to do moving forward.

00:12:43.367 --> 00:12:45.334
-The voters elected him
to serve.

00:12:45.334 --> 00:12:47.300
If there is a concern
and he has to go

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:49.734
through the Ethics,
let him move through that.

00:12:49.734 --> 00:12:50.901
-Are you going to take
any action

00:12:50.901 --> 00:12:52.200
against him at this point?

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:54.033
Are any of these allegations
acceptable to you?

00:12:54.033 --> 00:12:55.901
-What are the charges
against him?

00:12:55.901 --> 00:12:57.634
-Well, I mean, he's --
-Is there a charge against him?

00:12:57.634 --> 00:12:58.868
You know, in America today,

00:12:58.868 --> 00:13:00.567
you're innocent
until proven guilty.

00:13:00.567 --> 00:13:02.667
-[ As McCarthy ]
In America today, you're
innocent until proven guilty.

00:13:02.667 --> 00:13:05.200
Now, has anyone seen
my Burberry scarf?

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:07.033
[ Laughter ]
Santos!

00:13:07.033 --> 00:13:09.000
That's what happens when you
become the party of Trump --

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:10.467
you attract scammers
like Santos,

00:13:10.467 --> 00:13:12.601
who seemed to have lied
about virtually everything,

00:13:12.601 --> 00:13:14.601
from claiming he was a star
volleyball player

00:13:14.601 --> 00:13:16.367
to claiming he worked
at Goldman Sachs,

00:13:16.367 --> 00:13:17.400
to claiming he served as...

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:19.000
-President of the United States.

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:20.634
[ Laughter ]
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:13:20.634 --> 00:13:24.300
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

